wallpaper-suite (2.3.0~rc2) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Read PNG and JPEG sizes from file headers and keep a persistent library
    dimension index, so routine library refreshes avoid per-image decoders.
  * Add an idle-priority cache warmer timer that prepares library thumbnails
    and per-display previews after login and nightly.
  * Add GetDisplayPreviews for an overview of every display's wallpaper.

 -- Norvi <apt@globalentry.systems>  Thu, 12 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000

wallpaper-suite (2.3.0~rc1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Add an on-demand native settings manager with durable operation receipts.
  * Package its workers separately so it can use an existing 2.2 runtime
    without replacing the installed extension or starting a user service.

